      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's not surprising that you're feeling this way, especially after something as significant as your athletic career came to an abrupt end. Your identity was deeply tied to your performance, and now that's gone. It's natural to feel lost and without purpose. Your hands may not look the same, but they're still yours, and they'll still be yours even if you can't do the things you loved.",
