    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but thats just the thing... they're just tools now. they don't work. my whole life was about what my body could achieve, and now it's just this heavy, broken thing i have to carry around. it feels like i'm just waiting for something that isnt coming. like the story already reached its end and im just reading the blank pages at the back of the book. does that even make sense? it just feels so empty.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
