      "content": "exactly. it's just... heavy. like, i look at my old videos and see this person who was alive, and then i look in the mirror and there's nothing there. just a shell. it feels like i'm just dragging this corpse around every day. sometimes i think maybe it would be more dignified to just stop, you know? to not have to keep pretending there's something left to salvage when the best part of me is already gone.",
